  "releaseNotes": "**DI024 direct private helper loops** — hosted-service analysis now follows one-hop, directly invoked private helpers in the same type declaration and applies the existing helper-local scope/service loop checks. Unsafe helper-local reuse now reports, while uncalled helpers, deferred lambda/local-function/query invocations, transitive helpers, and cross-method field flow remain conservative and silent.",
